# Week 5 X collection: review sample contains REAL post text -> never committed.
# (Aggregate summaries data/week5_x_collection_summary.csv,
#  data/week5_x_nasa_ready_summary.csv, data/week5_relevance_metrics.csv hold NO
#  text and ARE tracked. The raw/relevant/candidate/checkpoint files live under
